==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Scissoroo]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is slightly harder than most other early Labyrinth levels, but still very easy. Running anti-Alien Labyrinth fodder isn't too bad of an idea here.

